<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Neurex started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Neurex started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said Thursday it had started coverage of Neurex Corp with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Menlo Park, Calif., biotechnology company closed Wednesday at 15-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
